/tmp-*

# Project documentation suite - shared with collaborators manually rather
# than through git
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/CODING_STANDARDS.md
/CI_SETUP.md
/docs/
launch-v2tracker.ps1

# The old EFT companion binary. Superseded by public/companion/*.ps1 plus the
# zip built from them, which ARE committed - they're a few KB of text, so none
# of the reasons to keep a build artifact out of git apply, and a fresh clone
# is complete rather than serving a 404 from the download button.
# This rule stays so a stray leftover .exe can't be committed by accident: a
# ~7MB binary committed even once is in history forever.
/public/companion/*.exe
